    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d325-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d325-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Reagan Library, Executive Secretariat, NSC Cable File, Falkland File
                    06/07/1982 (1). Confidential; Sensitive; Noforn. The telegram repeats an earlier
                    telegram from [<hi rendition="#italic">text not declassified</hi>] to the
                    Defense Intelligence Agency, sent at 1337Z, June 7. Printed from a copy that was
                    received in the White House Situation Room.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
